the latest apex trailer teases season 5  and there are a lot of important details  you might have missed let's break down  the biggest reveals in the trailer  season 5 called fortunes Faber brings  lobha into the fray  we already got her origin story from a  previous trailer her father was  assassinated by revenant and she's been  looking for revenge ever since the new  trailer shows us the end of her search  she enters a facility where we actually  learned some new revenant lore revenant  is not just one killer robot every time  he dies his consciousness gets uploaded  to a new body hence why he's so hard to  kill that consciousness comes from the  original assassins head which is mounted  in a facility beneath Kings Canyon Lobo  has come here to destroy the head  defeating revenant once and for all  she's actually using the same gun that  revenant wielded when he attacked her  family but she fails and revenant is  teleported to another facility however  her time in the facility seems to hint  at her abilities though respawn hasn't  announced what those are just yet in the  trailer we see her throw a disk and  teleport to its location this happens  when she first enters the facility  though we've seen examples of this in  previous trailers Lobos endgame  appearance on the lobby screen and a  world's edge Easter Egg we also see Lobo  use her staff to pull a gun from a  guards hand into hers Lobo also fights  off the guards using the staff so  perhaps that's also in ability enhanced  melee hits would be an interesting way  to spice up the Battle Royale the  facility itself is destroyed by the end  of the trailer and it looks to have  formed a lake where skull town currently  stands in Kings Canyon that's notable  for two reasons first new seasons have  always brought map changes to Apex so  the loss of an entire facility is  significant and may play into the quest  hinted at on season 5s main page second  it ties into the seasons split ranked  series just like season 4 fortunes favor  will have two separate series for ranked  matches they'll kick off in Kings Canyon  with the new season then shift back to  world's edge in June season 5 begins on  ps4 Xbox one and PC on May 12th we'll  have confirmation on Lola's abilities by  then so stay tuned a game spot for a  closer look at the new Legend  you  [Music]
 

